X cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", "{T}: Add {C} for each card you've drawn this turn.\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. If you spend this mana to cast your commander, it enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of times it's been cast from the command zone this game.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gains double strike until end of turn.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}, {T}, Pay life equal to the number of colors in your commanders' color identity: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Encroaching Wastes: Destroy target nonbasic land.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{R}{W}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains vigilance and haste until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Command Beacon: Put your commander into your hand from the command zone.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}. When you spend this mana to cast a spell with mana value 6 or greater, draw a card.\nPartner (You can have two commanders if both have partner.)', '{T}: Attach target Equipment you control to target creature you control.', '{T}: Choose a player. That player adds one mana of any color they choose.', "{T}: Choose one. X is the number of spells you've cast this turn.\n• Scry X.\n• Gnostro, Voice of the Crags deals X damage to target creature.\n• You gain X life.", "{T}: Cuombajj Witches deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to any target of an opponent's choice.", '{T}: Draw two cards. Target opponent gains control of Humble Defector. Activate only during your turn.', '{T}: Each player may draw a card, then each player who drew a card this way gains 1 life.', '{T}: Lightning-Rig Crew deals 1 damage to each opponent.\nWhenever you cast a Pirate spell, untap Lightning-Rig Crew.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target player mills a card. (They put the top card of their library into their graveyard.)\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Codex Shredder: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}: The player whose turn it is may end the turn. (Exile all spells and abilities from the stack. The player whose turn it is discards down to their maximum hand size. Damage wears off, and "this turn" and "until end of turn" effects end.)']
